/T (Every delegate in this room carries a dual responsibility which are to represent your countries economic interests with precision, and to also keep sight of what's best for the international financial system as a whole. We hope this background guide gives you enough grounding to research confidently, and draft resolutions that reflect real, workable policy.)
/E (Every delegate in this room carries a dual responsibility which are to represent your countries economic interests with precision, and to also keep sight of what's best for the international financial system as a whole. We hope this background guide gives you enough grounding to research confidently, and draft resolutions that reflect real, workable policy.)
